sequenceDiagram
    participant ApiCore as api-core (NestJS)
    participant PaymentSvc as payment-service (Java)
    participant PayPal
    participant Mailjet

    Note over ApiCore,PaymentSvc: Initiate Payment
    ApiCore->>PaymentSvc: POST /payments/orders {reference_id, origin, amount_usd, customer_email, idempotency_key}
    alt Idempotency key already exists
        PaymentSvc-->>ApiCore: Return existing Payment (no-op)
    else New payment
        PaymentSvc->>PaymentSvc: Create Payment(initiated)
        PaymentSvc->>PayPal: Create PayPal order
        PayPal-->>PaymentSvc: PayPal order ID + approval URL
        PaymentSvc-->>ApiCore: {payment_link, payment_service_ref}
    end

    Note over PayPal,PaymentSvc: PayPal Webhook (payment completed)
    PayPal->>PaymentSvc: POST /payments/webhooks/paypal
    PaymentSvc->>PaymentSvc: Validate webhook signature
    PaymentSvc->>PaymentSvc: Deduplicate by paypal_event_id
    PaymentSvc->>PaymentSvc: Payment.status = confirmed
    PaymentSvc->>PaymentSvc: Generate Receipt PDF (customer + admin)
    PaymentSvc->>Mailjet: Send receipts by email
    PaymentSvc->>ApiCore: POST /api/orders/webhooks/payment-result {status: ok}

    Note over ApiCore,PaymentSvc: Refund Request
    ApiCore->>PaymentSvc: POST /payments/orders/:ref/refund {reason, refund_request_id}
    alt Refund already exists (idempotent)
        PaymentSvc-->>ApiCore: Return existing Refund
    else New refund
        PaymentSvc->>PayPal: POST /v2/refunds/sale/:sale_id
        PayPal-->>PaymentSvc: Refund confirmed
        PaymentSvc->>PaymentSvc: Create Refund(processed)
        PaymentSvc->>PaymentSvc: Generate Refund Receipt PDF
        PaymentSvc->>Mailjet: Send refund receipt
        PaymentSvc-->>ApiCore: Refund processed
    end

    Note over PaymentSvc: Audit Log
    PaymentSvc->>PaymentSvc: Log all operations in AuditLog (actor, action, reference_id, payload, result)
